<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Privacy notice</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Privacy, in plain language.</h1><p class="lede fade">How information is handled on this company website and through a project inquiry.</p><p class="doc-meta">Last updated November 2, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#section-0">Who operates this website</a><a href="#section-1">What this website collects</a><a href="#section-2">Website platform information</a><a href="#section-3">If you contact us</a><a href="#section-4">The AI assistant</a><a href="#section-5">Recipients and retention</a><a href="#section-6">Privacy choices and requests</a><a href="#section-7">Product and client data</a><a href="#section-8">Changes to this notice</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">More</p><nav aria-label="Legal"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/legal{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-legal{% endif %}">All legal information</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="section-0"><i>01</i><h2>Who operates this website</h2><p>Velani is operated by VELANI LLC. Contact <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> about privacy, or write to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p></section><section id="section-1"><i>02</i><h2>What this website collects</h2><p>When you send an inquiry, we receive the name, email address, company, topic and message you enter. This website does not ask you to create an account and does not save your name, email or message to browser storage. Do not include credentials, payment details or sensitive records in a message.</p></section><section id="section-2"><i>03</i><h2>Website platform information</h2><p>The website is hosted on Shopify. Shopify and the platform providers it uses may process device, connection, security and storage information to operate the website. Shopify, the website platform, also collects visit and page-view information for analytics. Mailchimp, the email tool Velani uses for its mailing list, can receive visit information for analytics and marketing. You can turn optional analytics and marketing off in Cookie choices.</p></section><section id="section-3"><i>04</i><h2>If you contact us</h2><p>An inquiry you send through the form, or an email you write to us, contains your address, your message and any other information you include. We use it to handle the conversation you asked for. An inquiry is not consent to subscribe you to marketing.</p></section><section id="section-4"><i>05</i><h2>The AI assistant</h2><p>When the assistant is turned on, a button on each page opens it, and it answers questions about NEVORA and our services. When you use it, our hosting providers in the United States store the messages you send and the replies you receive for up to 30 days (Vercel for the service and Neon for its database). An AI model receives your messages through our AI gateway and generates each reply. Before a conversation starts, Cloudflare Turnstile checks that the request comes from a browser and not from an automated program. Answers can be wrong, and product details may change. The assistant does not ask for passwords, payment details or employee records; do not include them. You can delete a conversation from the assistant at any time. The contact form is separate: we handle an inquiry you send as described above.</p></section><section id="section-5"><i>06</i><h2>Recipients and retention</h2><p>Inquiries reach the <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> mailbox, where VELANI LLC reads them. We keep an inquiry while we need it for the conversation and any project that follows, unless the law requires us to keep it longer. The NEVORA app has its own retention rules, set out in the NEVORA privacy policy.</p></section><section id="section-6"><i>07</i><h2>Privacy choices and requests</h2><p>Open Cookie choices to review the choices this website offers. Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> to ask what we hold about you, to correct it or to have it deleted. The law that applies to you sets which rights you have. Before we act on a request, we may ask you to confirm your identity in a way that fits the request.</p></section><section id="section-7"><i>08</i><h2>Product and client data</h2><p>This notice concerns the company website. NEVORA workplace records are covered by the NEVORA privacy policy. Client processing, including any controller/processor responsibilities, must be covered by the relevant engagement and data-processing terms.</p></section><section id="section-8"><i>09</i><h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>When we change this notice, we update the date at the top of the page. This notice does not certify compliance with any standard.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></section>
